pentool/tui/screens/scanner/

# pentool-mcp-server — separate Git repository (DrXOps/pentool-mcp-server),
# installed via the PyPI extra `pentool[ai]`. Kept out of this repo to avoid
# embedding a nested git repo.
ai_server/

